### 4. Active runtime-mode reporting (prior blocker #3)

Requirement: UI data model must have a producer-side agentRuntime.runtime written from real IWorldOrchestration.HealthAsync or equivalent current local orchestration health/runtime status; stale fallback "iii + Hermes through App.Command" must be absent.

New file project/hosts/complete-app/RuntimeStatusViewSource.cs:
  - Implements FantaSim.App.Ui.IViewSource (line 9).
  - ViewId = "runtime-status" (line 20).
  - BuildDocument creates JsonObject["agentRuntime"]["runtime"] = GetRuntimeText() (lines 30-34).
  - GetRuntimeText calls _orchestration.HealthAsync().GetAwaiter().GetResult() (line 69) and returns:
      - "local in-process orchestration (healthy)" if health.Ok
      - "local in-process orchestration (degraded)" if not
      - "local in-process orchestration (unknown)" on exception

Registered in Host.cs ComposeUi (lines 141-147) by resolving the IWorldOrchestration from the registry and passing it to RuntimeStatusViewSource.

Stale fallback string search:
  Command: rg -n "iii \+ Hermes through App\\.Command" project
