## Residual notes (non-blocking)

- RuntimeStatusViewSource.BuildDocument calls _orchestration.HealthAsync().GetAwaiter().GetResult() synchronously. The current LocalOrchestrator.HealthAsync returns Task.FromResult, so this is safe for the present implementation. Future non-trivial orchestrators may want async document builds.
- RuntimeStatusViewSource is registered but not auto-mounted; a view consumer must request "runtime-status" for the value to render. This matches the existing IViewSource architecture.

